      "title": "Map Engine Demo",
      "mood": "curious",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Every day, thousands of ships carry the world's goods between Asia and Europe.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "globe": true,
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "view": {
                      "lon": 45,
                      "lat": 24,
                      "span": 120
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many of them squeeze through one narrow channel in Egypt, the Suez Canal.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "focus": [
                      "Egypt"
                    ],
                    "highlight": [
                      "Egypt"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "narrow channel",
                    "view": {
                      "lon": 32.45,
                      "lat": 30.55,
                      "span": 4.2
                    },
                    "routes": [
                      {
                        "path": "Suez Canal",
                        "mode": "line",
                        "seconds": 2.0
                      }
                    ],
                    "places": [
                      {
                        "name": "Port Said",
                        "kind": "port"
                      },
                      {
                        "name": "Suez",
                        "kind": "port"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the canal closes, ships must sail all the way around Africa, past the Cape of Good Hope.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "routes": [
                      {
                        "from": "Rotterdam",
                        "to": "Singapore",
                        "label": "Via Suez",
                        "seconds": 2.2
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "around Africa",
                    "routes": [
                      {
                        "from": "Rotterdam",
                        "to": "Singapore",
                        "avoid": [
                          "suez",
                          "panama"
                        ],
                        "color": "red",
                        "label": "Around Africa",
                        "seconds": 3.0
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "Cape of Good Hope",
                    "places": [
                      {
                        "name": "Cape of Good Hope"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At night, satellites show where people really live. In Egypt, almost everyone lives along the Nile.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "view": {
                      "lon": 31.0,
                      "lat": 26.8,
                      "span": 17
                    },
                    "layer": "night"
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "along the Nile",
                    "places": [
                      {
                        "name": "Cairo",
                        "kind": "capital"
                      },
                      {
                        "name": "Aswan"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maps can also mislead. On this kind of map, Greenland looks almost as big as Africa. In reality, Africa is about fourteen times larger.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "layer": "day",
                    "view": {
                      "lon": -10,
                      "lat": 45,
                      "span": 330
                    },
                    "highlight": [
                      "Greenland"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "In reality",
                    "true_size": {
                      "country": "Greenland",
                      "to": [
                        20,
                        3
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maps can show data too, like how many people live in each country.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "world": true,
                    "choropleth": {
                      "title": "Population, 2023",
                      "world_bank": "SP.POP.TOTL",
                      "year": 2023,
                      "scale": "log",
                      "source": "World Bank"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they can tell history. In 1956, Britain, France and Israel invaded Egypt over the canal.",
          "shots": [
            {
              "type": "map",
              "at": 0,
              "map": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "highlight": [
                      "Egypt"
                    ],
                    "focus": [
                      "Egypt"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "Britain",
                    "arrows": [
                      {
                        "from": [
                          33.0,
                          34.6
                        ],
                        "to": [
                          32.35,
                          31.35
                        ],
                        "label": "Britain & France"
                      },
                      {
                        "from": [
                          34.5,
                          31.3
                        ],
                        "to": [
                          33.0,
                          30.4
                        ],
                        "label": "Israel",
                        "bend": -0.25
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
